                        "entry_id": "67aff66d-e410-3803-9bc3-8815fd177741",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Temporary military living quarters."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a491afa9-f021-4029-ba90-50df7bef7be4",
                                "sense_id": "104c3f3d-d86e-3de2-8436-ab0567d6ccc3",
                                "text": "On the Umballa platform waited a detachment of officers discussing the latest news from the stricken cantonment, and it was here that Bobby learned the real condition of the Tail Twisters."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1af88a76-9869-37e7-b4ff-79457b05efd8",
                        "entry_id": "67aff66d-e410-3803-9bc3-8815fd177741",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A town or village, or part of a town or village, assigned to a body of troops for quarters."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae7382f2-460b-4ba1-a2e1-6d3e558bba6c",
                                "sense_id": "1af88a76-9869-37e7-b4ff-79457b05efd8",
                                "text": "The cantonments, it transpired, were singularly ill-sited for defence, being built on low, marshy ground, overlooked by hills on all sides."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5825c9f-1009-3abb-8ee9-941e8351c524",
